# Compiled .s output drops in next to each .p8 by default (`p8c foo.p8`).
# Snapshot .expected.s under tests/snapshots/ is intentionally tracked,
# so we only ignore .s under examples/, goldens/, and any local stems.
examples/*.s
tests/goldens/*.s
tinyp8/out/
tinyp8/**/*.body
tinyp8/**/*.runnable
__pycache__/
*.pyc
